  "title": [
    "[Elemental Confluence]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "Lining the mouth of a vast cave, raggedly formed stalagmites and stalactites lend the foreboding appearance of a feral animal baring a set of wickedly sharp teeth.  A thick, cinereous fog lurks at the base of the inlet, drifting its way toward a pocket of hole-riddled topography emiting shadowy steam from its depressions.  Tangible pressure builds in the atmosphere, unleashing rivulets of electricity that hiss and snap like an enraged serpent."
  ],
